⍝ ONE, TAKEN AT 0.9 SO A SOONER WIN IS WORTH MORE, OR TO THE
⍝ RESULT: 1 WON, 0 LOST, 0.5 DRAWN.
I←KEYS⍳CODES H
N←⍴I
